<title>USA: Kellstrom Industries Inc Q1 share up.</title>
<headline>Kellstrom Industries Inc Q1 share up.</headline>
<dateline>SUNRISE, Fla. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(unaudited)</p>
<p>						    Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							 March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net revenues			    $16,466,073    $ 5,270,995</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold		     10,726,985	3,482,015</p>
<p>    Gross profit			   5,739,088	1,788,980</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative			   1,770,329	  748,101</p>
<p>Dep. and amort. (including</p>
<p>  goodwill)				    288,879	   99,338</p>
<p>    Operating income		     3,679,880	  941,541</p>
<p>Interest expense - net of</p>
<p>  interest income			  1,035,858	  121,501</p>
<p>Income before income</p>
<p>	taxes				  2,644,022	  820,040</p>
<p> Income taxes				  984,654	  303,333</p>
<p>    Net income			     1,659,368	  516,707</p>
<p>    Net income per share			 .21		.09</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  shares				     9,146,176	8,050,454</p>
<p>NOTE: The company attributed increases in net income and revenues in part to internal growth and to the acquisition of International Aircraft Support, L.P., with its expanded customer base.</p>
</text>
